  "details": "As an individual with the use of only one hand, I use \"Sticky Keys,\" an accessibility feature that allows me to toggle the Shift, Ctrl, Alt, and Windows keys. You will notice that TAB isn't a toggleable key within Sticky Keys. I physically cannot fulfill the requirement to \"Holding TAB while in first person mode will release your mouse cursor and allow you to interact with the HUD.\" Please allow changing this from TAB to one of the mentioned \"sticky keys\" (or a key combination).\"",
